-- Catalog baseline: the complete schema of the catalog service on an empty PostgreSQL (squashed from the former
-- V1..V20 chain, which is gone: nothing was deployed, local databases are recreated).
--
-- Not here: platform_outbox / platform_inbox (db/platform, shared by every service) and the initial data
-- (V1_1__initial_data.sql, generated by tools/taxonomy/gen_catalog_baseline.py). New schema changes are V2, V3, ...
-- tools/catalog/compare_migrations.sh proves a database built from this file equals the one the old chain produced.
--
-- Areas: brand registry (brand, brand_scope, brand_key), taxonomy (category, product_type, category_request, size_chart,
-- taxonomy_audit), products (product, product_variant, product_draft, variant_tax_evidence), bulk upload
-- (product_import, product_import_row), enforcement (product_flag, product_takedown, org_listing_suppression,
-- listing_enforcement_run), reviews (product_review, product_review_report, product_rating), barcode lookups
-- (product_data_lookup) and unit labels (unit_label).

